Recorded residual risk (owner decision, 2026-11-20)
---------------------------------------------------
The owner authorized distribution of this build while the following provenance
questions are NOT rights-verified. They are recorded as an accepted risk, not as
a clearance, and `npm run verify:provenance` keeps reporting them:

- `spektrafilm-spectral-constants` — the spectral upsampling coefficients
  integrated from the hanatos spectral-upsampling research are redistributed
  without source-specific terms; the upstream CC BY-SA profile notice does not
  establish separate permission for every constant.
- `portra-setup-derived-tables`, `product-monochrome-derived-tables`,
  `cinestill-spatial-model` — derived tables that inherit that unresolved
  upstream data or that come from product profile work whose redistribution
  terms were not independently confirmed.

Recipients who need those bytes under a fully documented chain of title should
treat this part of the data as unresolved. Replacing the affected constants with
independently sourced standards data is the tracked follow-up; the engineering
record is ops/provenance/README.md and the tasks
11-06-spectral-license-provenance and 11-11-spektralab-full-stock-migration.
